'Generated...' image (light red rectangle).  The dashed lines delineate the=
 two distinct phases, highlighting the difference between using an input im=
age for training and using a random vector for generating new images during=
 inference." loading=3D"lazy" width=3D"476" height=3D"404" decoding=3D"asyn=
